WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
Nusumareta kako wo

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
Sagashitsuzukete

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Ore wa samayou

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
Mishiranu machi wo

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Honou no nioi shimitsuite

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Museru

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Sayonara wa itta hazu da

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
Wakareta hazu sa

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
Jigoku wo mireba

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
Kokoro ga kawaku

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Tatakai wa akita no sa

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
Sadame to areba

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Kokoro wo kimeru

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
Sottoshite oite kure

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Ashita ni

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Aa tsunagaru kyou gurai

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:49.580
Kan Yu, how could you be so stupid
as to go poking open a beehive?

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:52.670
Your team's mission was to
attack enemy headquarters

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:54.710
and bring the item back to us!

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.460
You'll follow a new strategy now!

00:01:56.830 --> 00:02:00.540
Your task force will use air squadron three

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:04.710
to make a detour up to Crescent Moon Lake
and make for your true objective!

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:07.540
I'll say it again: don't forget your true objective!

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:09.580
I'll give you the mission details later!

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:12.330
Our ultimate victory is riding on this operation!

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:13.880
This was an unforgivable failure!

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:16.710
How could they be so easily distracted
from their mission?!

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:18.670
We bear most of the responsibility.

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:21.420
However, the object is everything this time.

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:23.750
Now that the task force's existence
is out in the open,

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:25.920
going up the Munamera River is now impossible.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:31.170
They'll proceed to Crescent Moon Lake
and secretly cross it by boat.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.710
That'll put them the shortest distance
from enemy HQ.

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:35.920
I see.

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:39.630
Once they cross the lake,
they're on the Veela's doorstep.

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:42.920
Even if they're discovered
the mission is still achievable.

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:48.080
If the situation calls for it, we can call in Melkian
Army Intelligence's special forces division.

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:50.000
That won't be necessary.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:53.380
My Assemble base's AT troops
are the best there are.

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:55.080
We'll be able to handle this.

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:58.000
You're saying you can do this on your own?

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.290
Why, Captain.

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:02.960
We have Chirico on our side, remember?

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:09.040
Contact Blast

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.460
Man, it's finally settling down.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:16.500
It's been as busy as a real battlefield around here.

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:20.460
I never coulda handled it
without your help, Coconna.

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:22.290
You'll get a bonus for it.

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:23.830
Anything in particular you want?

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:26.040
Really? All right!

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:30.460
Drink up, pal! It's on the house!

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:33.420
You think barley tea tastes that good?

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:36.750
I want a new dress. My other one got burnt.

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:38.960
A bright red one, with pokora feathers.

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:42.170
Hmm, expensive. How about gabera feathers?

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:44.540
You cheapskate!
Those aren't in fashion anymore!

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:45.710
Pokora feathers or nothing!

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.420
All right, all right.

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:51.420
When the war ends, I'll have a ton of profit.

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:54.830
Then I can buy you one with
pokora feathers or whatever.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:57.080
So, it's gonna be over soon?

00:03:57.080 --> 00:04:01.290
Yeah. The big push starts
when Chirico's team succeeds.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.420
They're stealing that girl back, aren't they?

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:05.460
What do you know about it?

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:08.290
Nothing, just that I'm worried about him.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.790
It's a dangerous mission.

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:13.460
I wish the war would be over.

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:16.830
Then Vanilla and I can open up a new club.

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:19.710
We'll call it "Club Coconna."

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:22.580
And Chirico and everyone will
always come there to drink.

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:26.000
I suppose I can invest a little into it, if you want.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:32.380
Stupid Vanilla... He was a natural club manager.

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:35.920
Why'd he have to go volunteer to be a pilot?

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:51.880
This is Airman second class Vartla
in the patrol unit.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:54.630
I am currently four klicks northwest
of the island temple.

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:57.500
Visibility is excellent. Nothing unusual below me.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:00.330
Ypsilon!

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:02.750
Ramoh temple was attacked and destroyed.

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.750
You mean we spotted an advance party?

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:08.080
It was a secret task force that was moving upriver.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:10.170
Only five ATs, apparently.

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:11.580
Chirico?!

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:14.880
Yes. And their objective is clear.

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:15.880
Proto One, you mean?

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:20.210
Not just Proto One. They're after you as well!

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:23.790
They're trying to capture you
before their major push begins.

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:27.330
The Melkians are behind all this, of course.

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:31.380
Then give me the order to
send out the special AT unit.

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:33.580
It's too late.

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:37.830
They're moving somewhere else.
We lost track of them.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.080
But they'll turn up somewhere!

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:42.580
We're ordering everyone in the area
to look for them!

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.290
Be ready to move out on a second's notice!

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:46.380
Yes, sir!

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:53.170
Damn you, Chirico! This time you will die!

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:55.170
I won't let you have her!

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:15.080
Chirico, you managed to
infiltrate their base before.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.250
What's our real objective?

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:19.460
I think you know what it is.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:23.080
Potaria, all you have to do is follow your orders!

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:25.630
We're dropping right into their laps.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:27.670
I need to know what we'll be fighting for!

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:33.540
Besides, seems to me Chirico's the one
who has to get whatever it is we're after.

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.960
Chirico, come clean. Tell us!

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:41.040
All right. You know how the Veela
have an ace on their side?

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:43.040
The blue AT guy?

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:43.960
Yeah.

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:47.040
That's the only reason we're
dropping into the middle of them?

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:50.420
He's been coming out and fighting us till now.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.790
Are we trying to steal something, too?

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:54.420
No. That's it.

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:57.040
Cripes, you still don't trust us!

00:07:57.040 --> 00:08:00.710
Never mind. I'll get that blue AT.

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:14.630
They should be showing up soon.

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:17.420
Let 'em come! Ramoh temple will be avenged!

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:37.040
Enemy tanks spotted! I'm taking fire!

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:39.080
Twelve klicks southeast of Crescent Moon Lake!

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:41.790
Roger! Continue surveillance! Out!

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.710
What? Continue surveillance? Hold it!

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:51.460
Shit, the mission's blown!

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.960
We can't back outta this!

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:53.920
Right.

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:55.540
We just have to do it.

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:57.330
Don't try to stop us, Captain!

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.130
Why, you...

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.210
All right!

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:46.580
Knock 'em out!

00:09:58.710 --> 00:09:59.920
You little...!

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:24.080
We're under AT attack! It's the guys from Ramoh!

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:03.580
All quiet. All enemy tanks destroyed.

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:05.540
All right, pull out!

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:08.420
Good luck, Chirico!

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:18.460
Potaria and the others
don't know our real objective,

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:21.380
but I can see right through you.

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:23.380
What do you mean?

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:24.830
Don't play dumb.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:30.040
You'll get your friends to gang up on the blue AT,
while you go off and get the PS.

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:33.040
Well, whatever.

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:36.830
You shouldn't mind who takes credit in the end.

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:38.500
We're just following orders, after all.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:16.880
Did you hear our secret base
at Ramoh was destroyed?

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:19.460
There were only five ATs that did it.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.920
He was in one of them.

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:24.420
The war is coming to the palace as well?

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:26.500
Chirico and the others are the vanguard.

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:32.130
Or rather, they're being sent by
the Melkians to capture us.

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:35.920
I'm afraid. I'm afraid of battle.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:38.080
I'm afraid to stay here.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:44.790
I know. I know you're afraid to fight.

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:51.040
As the days go by, my fear of battle grows.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.670
Don't be afraid!

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:54.920
I'm here to protect you.

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:56.630
Are you in there, Ypsilon?

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:57.710
Yes, sir!

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.830
They called an emergency meeting.

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:01.170
Understood, sir.

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:13.750
Chirico... I'm afraid.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:21.630
We know what the ATs that
attacked Ramoh are doing.

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:27.210
A tank group encountered them two kilometers
southeast of Crescent Moon Lake.

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:29.330
The tank group was completely destroyed.

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:35.330
Again...

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:39.290
They helicoptered a boat in
and are sneaking across the lake.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:41.250
Most likely to attack us from behind.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.880
We've underestimated them.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:50.130
They've been defeating us from the start
and that's going to affect our troops' morale.

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:52.750
But their crossing the lake is our chance!

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:55.750
Send the special AT unit out, sir!

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:58.000
You're authorized to.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:58.960
Yes, sir!

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:00.830
The big problem is Proto One.

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:02.630
What do we do about her?

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:17.710
You don't believe in my power as a PS.

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.380
I never said that.

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:22.960
This country will be consumed by battle soon.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:26.210
If she's captured when that happens-

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:27.670
I won't let them!

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:29.330
That's no guarantee!

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:31.960
I was thinking of sending her to headquarters.

00:14:32.170 --> 00:14:34.210
Please don't do that, sir!

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:45.330
Is that what you call love?

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:50.790
We'll ask HQ's opinion in the matter.

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:55.460
What is it, Borough?

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:59.250
Sir, the situation here is growing tense.

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:00.420
Because of that...

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:03.130
I see. And you want to take care of Proto One.

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:04.420
Yes.

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.420
I don't think she should return to headquarters.

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:07.210
Huh?

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:12.040
We're only finding a few flaws
in our hard-won gem.

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:14.170
It can still be polished satisfactorily.

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:16.130
I don't think she'll be any use.

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:20.040
Seeing Chirico before being programmed
may have fatally sabotaged her.

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:26.250
Exactly. According to Giger's theory,
her first sight stimulus was an extreme shock.

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:29.670
That original shock must be erased
to return her to normal.

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:32.500
Is there any way to actually test this theory?

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:35.750
There is. And you'll be the one to do it.

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:41.500
You must kill Chirico in front of her, Ypsilon.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:47.040
She must see the exact moment of his death!

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:50.960
Borough, if this doesn't work, you're to kill her.

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:52.540
We've no use for defective equipment.

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:53.380
Yes, sir.

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:54.710
Move out, Ypsilon!

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:55.670
Yes, sir!

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:24.920
I must kill Chirico!

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:26.920
Only then can you be free.

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:58.170
Chirico, when you go off to do your job,
I'll take the blue AT.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.380
How about it, Shako?
Wanna bet on me doing it?

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:04.380
Quentians don't gamble.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.750
He reacts a lot faster than a normal person.

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:10.420
Sure you want to tell us all your secrets?

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:13.670
Your AT's standard maneuvering
patterns will be no use.

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:15.130
Then what should I do?

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:19.130
Keep up the attack. And don't give a inch.

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:21.500
Hell, that's what I do anyway.

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:32.210
Looks like we're gonna land okay.

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:33.670
Prep for combat!

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:50.540
No matter how I warned them, they seemed
even more determined to fight the PS.

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:54.460
Perhaps fighting is their only reason for existing.

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:06.290
What the..?!

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:09.460
What's happening?

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:16.670
There they are!

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:23.580
Get them!

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:51.670
Where's the blue AT?

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:30.580
Fyana!

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:37.960
Do you know who's in that AT?

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:39.040
Chirico!

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:43.330
Now watch carefully, Proto One.
Don't take your eyes off him!

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:58.670
Careful! They're still in the water!

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:05.130
Where is he? Where's he hiding?

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:10.630
There he is!

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:13.750
Ypsilon!

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:15.500
Chirico! I've been waiting for this!

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:17.500
This time you will die!

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:22.380
This is my only chance!

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:24.500
But will it work this time?

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:34.710
DIE!

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:39.460
Chirico!

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:41.290
Stop it, please!

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:43.080
Look! Don't turn away!

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:45.460
No!

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:47.170
I said look!

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:58.290
You're mine!

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:08.880
Give Chirico some help! Get that blue AT!

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:11.040
Hell, I wanna go!

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:13.790
But these guys won't let me, dammit!

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:27.960
Now, watch as Chirico dies!

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:37.250
The battle is mine, Chirico!

00:21:57.920 --> 00:21:59.000
Proto One!

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:01.130
Proto One, what are you doing?!

00:22:20.790 --> 00:22:22.130
PROTO ONE!

00:22:22.500 --> 00:22:23.460
Fyana!

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:40.460
In Ypsilon I had seen
an almost bottomless hatred for me.

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:42.420
And yet, I saw something else.

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:44.670
She'd risked her life for me.

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:46.880
Fyana...

00:22:47.710 --> 00:22:52.460
I felt an indescribable warmth fill my body.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
Next Episode

00:22:56.170 --> 00:22:58.960
A blazing jungle filled with madness.

00:22:58.960 --> 00:23:01.710
Some from desire. Some from destiny.

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:04.630
Clashing desires. Entangling bonds.

00:23:04.960 --> 00:23:09.210
Amidst a constant barrage,
an unexpected moment of peace.

00:23:09.210 --> 00:23:12.460
In the setting sun stand silhouetted two shadows.

00:23:12.460 --> 00:23:15.540
Yet their thoughts still sadly disagree.

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:18.250
Next time, "Complications"

00:23:18.420 --> 00:23:21.080
A farce is hidden in the darkness of the night.

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:24.290
Complications

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Samishii toki mo

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Kanashii toki mo

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
Itsumo anata ga me ni ukabu

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Hitori no toki mo

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.380
Aitai toki mo

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
Itsumo anata wa mune no naka

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
Tooku hanarete itemo

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
Tatoe wakarete itemo

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
Kono yo no hikari to tomo ni mabushiku

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Ano hi no anata ga...
